{
  "name": "643. BytePlus Seedance video: seconds follow the model's series, 2.5 takes 4 to 30 and 2.0 keeps 4 to 15 (byteplus seedance duration series)",
  "description": "Pins TXE-7809 for the byteplus provider on POST /v1/videos. Local fixture regression, no live provider calls: start tests/e2e/api/runners/provider-error-fixture.mjs, start an isolated gateway on tests/e2e/api/provider_config/provider-error-fixture.config.json and run with providerErrorFixture=1; every case is skipped otherwise. Ark documents the Seedance 2.5 series as [4, 30] or -1 and the 2.0 series as [4, 15] or -1. Rows 2 to 4: 31 seconds on dreamina-seedance-2-5-260628 and on dreamina-seedance-2-5-flash-261115, and 16 seconds on dreamina-seedance-2-0-260128, are each refused with 400 caller_unsupported_parameter naming seconds; row 5 proves none reached Ark. Rows 6 and 7: 30 seconds on each 2.5 model returns a queued task; before the change both were refused, because every Seedance model was held to 15. Row 8 proves both creates reached Ark with duration 30.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "643.1 reset the fixture's counters and wire capture before the refused creates (byteplus seedance duration series)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{providerErrorFixtureUrl}}/__reset"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('the fixture reset its counters', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'failed: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql(200);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data[0].reset).to.eql(true);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "643.2 [EXPECT-400] byteplus POST /v1/videos refuses 31 seconds on dreamina-seedance-2-5, past the 2.5 series' 30 (byteplus seedance duration series)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"byteplus/dreamina-seedance-2-5-260628\",\n  \"prompt\": \"a paper boat on a pond\",\n  \"seconds\": \"31\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/videos",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "videos"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('seconds is refused as caller_unsupported_parameter naming the field', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'failed: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql(400);",
              "  var j = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(j.extra_fields && j.extra_fields.error_type, 'error_type: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql('caller_unsupported_parameter');",
              "  pm.expect(j.error && j.error.param, 'error.param: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql('seconds');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
